Subject: [PATCH 014/207] deepseek: supervise blocked session snapshots

Address Jenpo's issue #38 recovery contract through an owned snapshot progress scope. The host fault fixture blocks the actual snapshot synchronization call and proves independent stall notification before partial publication, then checks a fresh synchronization. This is a bounded recovery check, not proof of the original GPU stall cause.
